    { soalan: "Why is transitioning from coal power stations to solar and wind power critical for long-term environmental sustainability?", pilihan: ["Coal is infinite while solar energy runs out in 10 years", "Solar and wind generate electricity without emitting greenhouse gases (CO2) or acid-rain pollutants (SO2)", "Coal plants produce too much oxygen", "Wind turbines work without moving parts"], jawapanBetul: 1, nota: "Tenaga suria dan angin tidak membebaskan gas rumah hijau (CO2) atau sulfur dioksida yang menyebabkan pemanasan global dan hujan asid." }
